   "latex": "\\begin{aligned}s^4&=\\left\\{\\frac{S(x_1^2)}{n}-\\left(\\frac{S(x_1)}{n}\\right)^2\\right\\}^2\\\\&=\\left(\\frac{S(x_1^2)}{n}\\right)^2-\\frac{2S(x_1^2)}{n}\\left(\\frac{S(x_1)}{n}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{S(x_1)}{n}\\right)^4\\\\&=\\frac{S(x_1^4)}{n^2}+\\frac{2S(x_1^2x_2^2)}{n^2}-\\frac{2S(x_1^4)}{n^3}-\\frac{4S(x_1^2x_2^2)}{n^3}+\\frac{S(x_1^4)}{n^4}\\\\&\\quad+\\frac{6S(x_1^2x_2^2)}{n^4}+\\text{other terms involving odd powers of } x_1 \\text{ etc., which will vanish on summation.}\\end{aligned}",
